1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
TEAM8 AiLamp | Expressive Motion
Five joints. Six gestures.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:08,600
Wake-up: posture and orientation change,
as the lamp takes on an attentive stance.

3
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:15,700
Curiosity: a tilted head and changing orientation
suggest interest in something nearby.

4
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:23,133
Nod: repeated up-and-down head movements
express acknowledgment or a positive response.

5
00:00:24,333 --> 00:00:30,633
Scanning: the lamp sweeps across different directions,
as if looking around for a point of interest.

6
00:00:31,833 --> 00:00:36,633
Headshake: a side-to-side gesture
suggests disagreement or a negative response.

7
00:00:37,833 --> 00:00:42,000
Idle: small posture changes
keep the lamp visually engaged between gestures.

8
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:45,866
A simple motion vocabulary:
attention, curiosity, and non-verbal responses.
